{"3960160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mad Cleaners", "steam_appid": 3960160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/a6611d3eac9faa015113e705cd799acc.avif?t=1761840088\" width=923 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends play as a team of extreme cleaners mysteriously hired by an unknown company to erase the traces of failed experiments in their laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourselves and earn money by completing missions without being spotted by the dangerous monsters in the laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress to unlock new maps, new equipment that is as useful as it is silly, and skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to get into debt, or the company won't be happy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/58b6931a16ad9692970823f0f5c967af.avif?t=1761840088\" width=693 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each laboratory has its own theme, missions, traps, and monsters, offering a completely different gaming experience from one laboratory to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each laboratory is procedurally generated, allowing for constant replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the laboratory selection menu, you can choose between several difficulty levels, with each level adding a new mission and potentially changing the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/d272411d5611acade23ff32285ffe32f.avif?t=1761840088\" width=586 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts are optional secondary objectives that can be completed alongside the main mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objectives and rewards offered by contracts are often completely offbeat and fun, such as ridiculous skins or unique items, and will add a little spice to your adventures.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/a6611d3eac9faa015113e705cd799acc.avif?t=1761840088\" width=923 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends play as a team of extreme cleaners mysteriously hired by an unknown company to erase the traces of failed experiments in their laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourselves and earn money by completing missions without being spotted by the dangerous monsters in the laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress to unlock new maps, new equipment that is as useful as it is silly, and skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to get into debt, or the company won't be happy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/58b6931a16ad9692970823f0f5c967af.avif?t=1761840088\" width=693 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several types of laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each laboratory has its own theme, missions, traps, and monsters, offering a completely different gaming experience from one laboratory to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each laboratory is procedurally generated, allowing for constant replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the laboratory selection menu, you can choose between several difficulty levels, with each level adding a new mission and potentially changing the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/extras/d272411d5611acade23ff32285ffe32f.avif?t=1761840088\" width=586 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contracts are optional secondary objectives that can be completed alongside the main mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objectives and rewards offered by contracts are often completely offbeat and fun, such as ridiculous skins or unique items, and will add a little spice to your adventures.</p>", "short_description": "An online cooperative game for up to 4 players, combining horror and entertainment. Clean laboratories filled with traps and dangerous creatures to earn money and make your cleaning agency profitable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/829de5bb5f602e67eb18cee8e4b02a533da3bcb7/header.jpg?t=1761840088", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/7ec0da48fd2b9199a58bb09dd62aef43738f5276/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761840088", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960160/7ec0da48fd2b9199a58bb09dd62aef43738f5276/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761840088", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network: